+/* Platform-specific types and definitions for egl.h
+ * $Revision: 12306 $ on $Date: 2010-08-25 09:51:28 -0700 (Wed, 25 Aug 2010) $
+ *
+ * Adopters may modify khrplatform.h and this file to suit their platform.
